{
  "_readme": "Occult Foundry - an occult steampunk/dieselpunk world: lamplit brass and copper, poured concrete, rust-streaked iron, varnished timber, tar welling up through the mud, and spirits in the air. Like Soot & Tar it is a recolour, not a replacement: every block keeps its own model and pattern. About 18% of woodland is haunted - spectral groves of bleached, frost-pale trees with cold-lit canopies and wisp blooms underfoot. Rust & Rebar (both mod ids), Tarbound and Create are left exactly as they are, since they're already on theme. Tune: each set's mix/saturation/brightness, the decals' opacity, the haunt percent (blight blocks on the log/leaf/flower rules - keep them identical), and the grade uniforms in assets/occult/shaders/post/grade.json.",
